flowchart TD
    A[Saved mix consistency check] --> B{Missing files found?}
    B -- No --> C[status=consistent]
    B -- Yes --> D[Store first_missing_ts per missing track]
    D --> E[Update first_inconsistent_ts]
    E --> F[Read Kodi library freshness]
    F --> G{Library timestamp known?}
    G -- No --> H[update_library_before_repair]
    G -- Yes --> I{Library freshest ts >= first_inconsistent_ts?}
    I -- No --> H
    I -- Yes --> J[repair_ready]

    J --> K[Auto-repair lookup]
    K --> L{Unique high-confidence candidate?}
    L -- Yes --> M[Repair automatically]
    L -- No --> N[Manual selection or no repair]
